's comments and legislative proposals, have drawn attention but no independent polling has corroborated a close race. The forecast expects McCormick to win by a solid double-digit margin, with Kozycki needing an external environment shift to make this competitive.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0501, "margin": -12.18}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1218, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0672, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0801, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0796, "margin": -10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0786, "margin": -10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0751, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0581, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0723, "margin": -11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0639, "margin": -11.0}]}